@base = http://localhost:3000

### Zadanie 1 - wszystkie sale
GET {{base}}/api/rooms

### Zadanie 1 - pojedyncza sala
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/1

### Zadanie 1 - 404 nieistniejaca sala
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/99

### Zadanie 2 - :id niepoprawne -> 400 (a nie 404)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/abc

### Zadanie 2 - roomId w query niepoprawne -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/reservations?roomId=abc

### Zadanie 2 - wiele bledow naraz (w tym nieznane pole status) -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":"x","reservedBy":" a ","participants":-2,"startTime":"2026-11-10T10:00:00","status":"CONFIRMED"}

### Zadanie 3 - nieistniejaca sciezka -> 404 JSON
GET {{base}}/api/nope

### Zadanie 3 - niepoprawny JSON -> 400 INVALID_JSON
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": 1,

### Zadanie 3 - nieoczekiwany blad -> 500 (requestId z naglowka)
GET {{base}}/api/debug/crash
X-Request-Id: demo-crash-123

### Zadanie 4/5 - istniejaca rezerwacja 10:00-12:00 w sali 1 -> 201 + Location (id 2)
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":20,"startTime":"2026-11-10T10:00:00.000Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T12:00:00.000Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - 12:00-13:00 -> OK (styka sie)
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T12:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T13:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - 08:00-10:00 -> OK (podane w strefie +01:00)
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T09:00:00+01:00","endTime":"2026-11-10T11:00:00+01:00"}

### Zadanie 4 - 11:00-13:00 -> 409 ROOM_ALREADY_BOOKED
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T11:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T13:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - 09:00-13:00 -> 409 (zawiera istniejaca)
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T09:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T13:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - 10:30-11:00 -> 409 (zawiera sie w istniejacej)
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T10:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T11:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - 10:00-12:00 w innej sali -> OK
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":3,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T12:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 5 - anulowanie przyszlej rezerwacji (id 2) -> 200, ustawione cancelledAt
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/2/cancel

### Zadanie 5 - ponowne anulowanie -> 200, ten sam cancelledAt
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/2/cancel

### Zadanie 4 - 10:00-12:00 gdy istniejaca jest CANCELLED -> OK
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-10T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T12:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 5 - anulowanie rozpoczetej rezerwacji (seed id 1) -> 409 RESERVATION_ALREADY_STARTED
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/1/cancel

### Zadanie 5 - anulowanie nieistniejacej -> 404
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/99/cancel

### Zadanie 4 - endTime nie pozniejsze niz startTime -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-11T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - krocej niz 15 minut -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-11T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-11T10:10:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - dluzej niz 8 godzin -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-11T08:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-11T17:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - startTime w przeszlosci -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2025-11-11T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2025-11-11T11:00:00Z"}

### Zadanie 4 - przekroczona pojemnosc sali -> 409
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":4,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":50,"startTime":"2026-11-11T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-11T11:00:00Z"}

### Nieistniejaca sala -> 404
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":99,"reservedBy":"Jan Kowalski","participants":5,"startTime":"2026-11-11T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-11T11:00:00Z"}

### Wszystkie rezerwacje
GET {{base}}/api/reservations

### Filtrowanie po roomId=1
GET {{base}}/api/reservations?roomId=1

### Pojedyncza rezerwacja (adres z naglowka Location)
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/2
